[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0010","text":"太好了！\n是七星瓢虫！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0020","text":"冬优子酱，你觉得下一个会出什么！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0030","text":"谁知道呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0040","text":"哦，扭蛋机好多啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0004","text":"……那这个，\n要怎么处理？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0005","text":"那下一个，\n是深山锹甲！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_00_0006","text":"冬优子觉得\n会出什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_01_0010","text":"啊——……\n摆事务所里！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_01_0020","text":"……听到了吧\n管理就交给你了，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_02_0010","text":"没中呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_02_0020","text":"真可惜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_03_0010","text":"连你也……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05020000_03_0020","text":"本来我就不知道还会出什么别的"}]
